      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STREAM IT (8) flew the lids with a fast early split and went on to clock 29.35 when a 4.5 lengths winner over 515m at this track. Comes through a solid form race last start. Expected to measure up again. PAW MONET (4) took the sit on the lead but levelled up to score (29.76) at this track in a Grade 5 over 515m. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. PAW GERTRUDE (7) goes very well at the course and distance with two wins and a placing from six starts. In the money last time at Geelong (25.96) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 3 length third. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. QUINLEE BALE (2) hit the frame here last start so don't underestimate.",
